{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39760","headline":"壬癸岁书情 · 黄滔","name":"壬癸岁书情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故园招隐客，应便笑无成。\n谒帝逢移国，投文值用兵。\n孤松怜鹤在，疎柳恶蝉鸣。\n匹马迷归处，青云失曩情。\n江头寒夜宿，壠上歉年耕。\n冠盖新人物，渔樵旧弟兄。\n易生唯白发，难立是浮名。\n惆怅灞桥路，秋风谁入行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39760.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39760","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}